    "Run with /bin/sh, which has no Homebrew PATH: use absolute paths. It must return at once: open -a …, or end with &. Placeholders: {script} is the generated script, {dir} the working folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird mit /bin/sh ausgeführt, das den PATH von Homebrew nicht kennt: Verwende absolute Pfade. Er muss sofort zurückkehren: open -a … oder mit & enden. Platzhalter: {script} ist das erzeugte Skript, {dir} der Arbeitsordner."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run with /bin/sh, which has no Homebrew PATH: use absolute paths. It must return at once: open -a …, or end with &. Placeholders: {script} is the generated script, {dir} the working folder."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se ejecuta con /bin/sh, que no tiene el PATH de Homebrew: usa rutas absolutas. Debe volver enseguida: open -a …, o terminar con &. Marcadores: {script} es el script generado, {dir} la carpeta de trabajo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exécutée avec /bin/sh, qui n’a pas le PATH de Homebrew : utilisez des chemins absolus. Elle doit rendre la main aussitôt : open -a …, ou se terminer par &. Variables : {script} est le script généré, {dir} le dossier de travail."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eseguito con /bin/sh, che non ha il PATH di Homebrew: usa percorsi assoluti. Deve tornare subito: open -a …, oppure termina con &. Segnaposto: {script} è lo script generato, {dir} la cartella di lavoro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
